      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cape_May%2C_New_Jersey",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "At summer's end, dragonflies and monarch butterflies pause in Cape May Point to rest before continuing across Delaware Bay.",
